WEBVTT

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.036
we can't capture
the carbon dioxide at source,

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.963
so we have to recapture it,
take it back out of the atmosphere.

00:05:04.501 --> 00:05:07.017
That can be done;
there's companies already doing it,

00:05:07.041 --> 00:05:08.594
but it's more expensive.

00:05:08.618 --> 00:05:11.646
And this points to the single
most important reason

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.926
why recapturing and safe disposal
of carbon dioxide

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.366
is not already standard practice:

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.586
cost.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:23.616
It's infinitely cheaper just to dump
carbon dioxide into the atmosphere

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:28.786
than it is to capture it
and dispose of it safely back underground.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.176
But the good news is,